@startuml
actor "Authorized Recorder" as Actor
participant "Swing Client" as UI
participant "Payment Use Case" as UC
participant "Payment / Balance Domain" as Domain
database "Relational Store" as DB

Actor -> UI : enter debtor, creditor, amount, date
UI -> UC : recordPayment(command, actor session)
UC -> DB : begin transaction; lock pairwise position
DB --> UC : current net outstanding debt
UC -> Domain : validate amount <= outstanding debt
alt valid partial or full payment
  Domain --> UC : payment + counter-posting
  UC -> DB : insert payment and unique ledger posting;\nupdate projection and audit
  DB --> UC : commit
  UC --> UI : payment history item + new net balance
  UI --> Actor : show settled/remaining amount
else invalid / amount exceeds debt
  Domain --> UC : validation/conflict error
  UC -> DB : rollback without financial mutation
  UC --> UI : explicit rejection
  UI --> Actor : show reason; balance unchanged
end
note over UC,DB
Debt is rechecked under transaction serialization.
Retries use an idempotency key; no duplicate payment.
end note
@enduml
